<Slide notes={`这两张图点数不一样，是故意的。

左边每一组只有三个点，因为每组只跑三次 Run，横线是汇总闭环率。

右边每个点是一项已经闭环的任务，A 组有六项、B 组有八项，一共十四个点，横线各自落在成功子集的中位数上：A 是 9.5 分钟，B 是 13.5 分钟。

为什么不能把右边的两点连起来当成配对任务的用时差？因为两组的成功子集可能不是同一批任务，连起来就等于假定了它们一一对应。

还有一点得说清楚：这里没有给未完成的任务估一个完成时间。60 分钟只是截止，把它填成完成时间会同时抬高平均值和时间分布。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>4.9.4　成功子集的用时</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>闭环率与时延，点数为什么不同</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 40, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 28, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>左：每一点是一次 Run 的闭环率　·　右：每一点是一项已闭环任务的时延　·　未完成的任务没有完成时间</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 300, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>每组 3 次 Run，每次 4 项任务（示意）</Text>

                <Box style={{ width: 524, height: 52, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 48 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>A01</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>2 / 4 ＝ 50%</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 524, height: 52, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 48 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>A02</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>3 / 4 ＝ 75%</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 524, height: 52, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 48 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>A03</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#D7E2EC', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>1 / 4 ＝ 25%</Text>
                </Box>

                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>实心＝该项任务闭环。横线＝汇总闭环率 50%；B 组三次为 75%、75%、50%，汇总约 66.7%。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 300, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>已闭环任务：A 6 项，B 8 项</Text>

                <Box style={{ width: 524, height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
